{"title":"2024 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)==_(MATH-X)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)== (MATH-X)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks_Now\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks_Now</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_(Goes_through_full_thought_process)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle (Goes through full thought process)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4_(Quick_and_Easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution  4 (Quick and Easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5 Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_7_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 7 Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_8_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 8 WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">20</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-21\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">21</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the unit digit of: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/6/156c3662fe4c874a80e54887f76c302c13b9d14c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[222{,}222-22{,}222-2{,}222-222-22-2?\\]\" width=\"324\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/969c84464d565acdb4c0fdf0454caeca271a61bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 0\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 2\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 4\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 8\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"364\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rewrite the expression as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/f/5bfe648fa82428a22a20d1a1fd5973fee76b2e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222,222-(22,222+2,222+222+22+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"342\" height=\"20\" />. We note that the units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f73ff684c4cd0450bbc10a9b2a080d0a5989a2df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22,222+2,222+222+22+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"243\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because all the units digits of the five numbers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66fed53f70f741a313c395f613ff2c696014d6eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cdot2=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, which has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Now, we have something with a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> subtracted from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/6/256d90b676a08244352573beb03015ee1f3dc36e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222,222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"17\" />, and so the units digit of this expression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909612b1ac69ce3f3770f46e5cb13846ba6454ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65f267d69bed2998343ebacfb03bdb51895befe1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[222,222-22,222 = 200,000\\]\" width=\"224\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/f/e0f3feeaabb6a0475cbc4a4e1e671405be4bfd9a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[200,000 - 2,222 = 197778\\]\" width=\"206\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/6/cb673ea3ee34766e705954c7d27eaf8c67d46c7e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[197778 - 222 = 197556\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac90567551c4edf02afb197258e816e4a85f05ca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[197556 - 22 = 197534\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/e/8ee577692ffa6b0660b721ceb15519c8e60b3297.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[197534 - 2 = 197532\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"13\" />\nSo our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909612b1ac69ce3f3770f46e5cb13846ba6454ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />. (Note that brute forcing takes lots of time and the AMC8 is a timed test)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We only care about the units digits. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e397e23ac15b0016f6b1e293bd288d33fac2d725.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-2$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e6071d486d0b1fc3d6ce72ef064aabed7e9e98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> after regrouping(10-2) ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c33c19d829bf4b90ad5c75dd2badede669c5b4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/4/7242090ebfb45c9a1da0a69eff31d045206c0dcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/3/e83804a0dc46a7c2245f307fc9dfc287ac6d531b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909612b1ac69ce3f3770f46e5cb13846ba6454ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We just take the units digit of each and subtract, adding an extra ten to the first number so we don't get a negative number:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f31cf010b9cbb2639ce1593ce0eab12ef1294c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(12-2)-(2+2+2+2)=10-8=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 2}\\]\" width=\"355\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/1/d117de6eed4b55e6a27b81ab3c47300579334b87.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[222{,}222-22{,}222-2{,}222-222-22-2\\equiv2-2-2-2-2\\equiv-8\\equiv\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 2}\\pmod{10}\\]\" width=\"619\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can ignore the other digits and just do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/3/2b3519bd15c4559b13bd3ee83e3a168845510657.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22-2-2-2-2-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"15\" />. Because you are subtracting five <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a89afb1b1bb51fd672b9d42d7e94b39a8f110f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb1b4466570e3d9af99d0abcae5804488548067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot5 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />, you subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. This gives us 12, so the last digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909612b1ac69ce3f3770f46e5cb13846ba6454ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bSPWqeNO11M?si=HIzlxPjMfvGM5lxR\">https://youtu.be/bSPWqeNO11M?si=HIzlxPjMfvGM5lxR</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3MtJRXIIxyM\">https://youtu.be/3MtJRXIIxyM</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_.28First_fully_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29.3D.3D_.28MATH-X.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)==_(MATH-X)\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)== (MATH-X)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)== (MATH-X)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=O0O0g7qq9AbhQN9I&amp;t=130\">https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=O0O0g7qq9AbhQN9I&amp;t=130</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28Detailed_Explanation.29_.F0.9F.9A.80.E2.9A.A1.F0.9F.93.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\">Video Solution 1 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Youtube Link ⬇️\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jqsbMWhTYRg\">https://youtu.be/jqsbMWhTYRg</a>\n</p><p>~ ChillGuyDoesMath&#160;:)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks_Now\">Video by MathTalks_Now</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks_Now\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crn37TRMLv4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crn37TRMLv4</a>\n</p><p>-rc1219\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_.28Goes_through_full_thought_process.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vide